<title>CHINA: Waigaoqiao 96 net down 6.03 pct.</title>
<headline>Waigaoqiao 96 net down 6.03 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	     648.155	  vs	 468.585</p>
<p> Net profit	   113.899	  vs	 121.208</p>
<p> Net asset per share    1.873 yuan    vs	 1.764 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.185 yuan    vs	 0.197 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Waigaoqiao Free Trade Zone Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Friday. The figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a cash dividend of 0.10 yuan per share, pending approval of a shareholders meeting.</p>
</text>
